# Apache settings for a make dist tree.  Needs "AllowOverride FileInfo" in
# the server config for the AddType lines, or the server answers 500.

# WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming refuses a .wasm served as anything else,
# and browsers refuse to run a module script sent under a generic type.
# Not every server's mime.types file lists them, so say so here.
AddType application/wasm .wasm
AddType text/javascript .mjs
